id: solar-flared
name: Solar Flared
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Solar Flare x100's mark beside the Blinded it gave, on the same clock - to the end of their next
# turn.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Blinded by Solar Flare x100: your Clairvoyance Skill Checks 4 lower.
text: >
  Solar Flared: "While an Opponent suffers from the Blinded Combat Condition through the effects of Solar Flare, reduce
  their Clairvoyance Skill Checks by 4."

---

[passive]
skill.clairvoyance.bonus -= 4;
